# Lofty Denial: "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}. If you control a creature with flying, counter that
# spell unless its controller pays {4} instead." The first Ancestral Recall is paid for with one spare Island; once Bot1
# has an Ornithopter the second needs {4}, which Bot2 cannot make, and it is countered. (The third card in Bot2's
# graveyard is the Island it discards to hand size in between.)

